abstract: >-
  Full implementations of the 3GPP 256-bit algorithm sets (256-NEA, 256-NIA and
  256-NCA with Snow 5G, AES-256 and ZUC-256, and the shared 256-AEAD1 framework)
  at several optimization levels for an ESP32, a Raspberry Pi 5, an AMD Zen 4
  processor and a Spartan-7 FPGA, with the benchmark, timing-leakage and energy
  programs, all raw measurement data, and the scripts that rebuild the merged results
  and the supplementary tables.
